  DisplayName: Eastern Customs Tightened
  EventType: 1
  Description: Customs offices in the far east {have tightened|are expected to tighten} their
    inspections, and crates of Chinese goods {sit|will sit} on the quays for weeks. Fewer Chinese
    pieces {reach|will reach} the market, those already here {fetch|may fetch} more, and some
    buyers {turn|will turn} to Japanese wares instead.
